	"system": {
		"description": {
			"value": "<p><strong>Bonus Action</strong> - 30 ft. Radius (60 ft.) - 1 Minute - Magical</p><p>You cause a deluge of sticky mud to form around a point. The mud counts as &amp;reference[difficult terrain]. When you use this ability and at the start of your turns, creatures in the mud are affected by the mud.</p><p><strong>[[/save str]]{Strength Save}</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Failure:</strong> Target is &amp;reference[grappled] by the mud. Target rolls again at end of their turns, ending effect on success. If they fail two &amp;reference[savingthrow]{saving throws} against this effect in a row, they are &amp;reference[restrained] until they successfully save against the effect or the effect ends.</p></li><li><p><strong>Success:</strong> No effect.</p></li></ul>",
			"chat": ""
		},
